        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#07141b;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#10252f'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:3.4cqw 5cqw 4cqw;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#efeadb,#e0dac2 55%,#cfc8a8);border:.5cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.2cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e'>Captain&#39;s log · first seen 1870</div><div style='font:700 6.4cqw/1 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#10252f;margin:1.2cqw 0 .6cqw'>Captain Nemo</div><div style='font:italic 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0f5560'>Engineer · explorer · exile</div><section style='margin-top:2.4cqw;padding-top:0cqw;'><div style='width:100%;aspect-ratio:780 / 590;border-radius:1.2cqw;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 .4cqw 1.2cqw rgba(42,33,24,.35)'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 780 590' width='100%' height='100%' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid meet' role='img' aria-label='Captain Nemo character dossier'><defs><linearGradient id='hull' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#123646'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#07202b'/></linearGradient><radialGradient id='water' cx='50%' cy='28%' r='80%'><stop offset='0' stop-color='#2b8fa0'/><stop offset='.55' stop-color='#0f4a5c'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='#04202b'/></radialGradient><clipPath id='port'><circle cx='209' cy='294' r='156'/></clipPath></defs><rect width='780' height='590' rx='14' fill='url(#hull)'/><rect x='15' y='15' width='750' height='560' rx='6' fill='none' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M36 104H744M36 481H744' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='2'/><text x='38' y='47' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='14' letter-spacing='4' fill='#c9a24b'>SUBMARINE FIELD DOSSIER</text><text x='742' y='47' font-family='monospace' font-size='13' text-anchor='end' fill='#c9a24b'>FILE 002 / CLASSIFIED</text><text x='390' y='92' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='51' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' fill='#f3e3b3'>CAPTAIN NEMO</text><g clip-path='url(#port)'><rect x='53' y='138' width='312' height='312' fill='url(#water)'/><path d='M70 30L110 30L154 330L34 330Z' fill='#bff0ea' opacity='.07'/><path d='M150 30L190 30L234 330L114 330Z' fill='#bff0ea' opacity='.07'/><path d='M230 30L266 30L305.6 330L197.6 330Z' fill='#bff0ea' opacity='.07'/><path d='M300 30L330 30L363 330L273 330Z' fill='#bff0ea' opacity='.07'/><circle cx='120' cy='410' r='7' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='141' cy='372' r='4' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='150' cy='430' r='5' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='278' cy='396' r='6' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='292' cy='352' r='3.5' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='262' cy='438' r='4' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='318' cy='300' r='5' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='104' cy='300' r='4' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><circle cx='300' cy='232' r='3' fill='none' stroke='#9fd8d2' stroke-width='1.6' opacity='.7'/><path d='M96 450Q102 372 156 356L180 330L238 330L262 358Q318 372 326 450Z' fill='#14303c' stroke='#061219' stroke-width='4'/><path d='M170 360L208 414L246 360L232 352L208 380L184 352Z' fill='#d9d3bf'/><circle cx='208' cy='424' r='4.5' fill='#c9a24b'/><circle cx='208' cy='444' r='4.5' fill='#c9a24b'/><path d='M192 322L224 322L222 346L194 346Z' fill='#b58a63'/><path d='M163 258Q158 196 208 186Q258 196 253 258Q251 314 208 338Q165 314 163 258Z' fill='#c19a73' stroke='#2a1c12' stroke-width='3'/><path d='M163 262Q166 332 208 346Q250 332 253 262Q242 300 208 302Q174 300 163 262Z' fill='#2b2420'/><path d='M184 284Q208 270 232 284Q220 296 208 290Q196 296 184 284Z' fill='#2b2420'/><path d='M180 252L202 258M236 252L214 258' stroke='#2b2420' stroke-width='5' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='192' cy='264' r='3.2' fill='#2b2420'/><circle cx='224' cy='264' r='3.2' fill='#2b2420'/><path d='M154 226Q158 184 208 176Q258 184 262 226Z' fill='#15303b' stroke='#061219' stroke-width='4'/><rect x='154' y='216' width='108' height='16' fill='#0d1f27'/><ellipse cx='208' cy='234' rx='64' ry='9' fill='#0b1a21'/><circle cx='208' cy='203' r='11' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='2'/><text x='208' y='208' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='14' font-weight='bold' fill='#3a2a08'>N</text></g><circle cx='209' cy='294' r='156' fill='none' stroke='#c9a24b' stroke-width='14'/><circle cx='209' cy='294' r='149' fill='none' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='372.0' cy='294.0' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='359.6' cy='356.4' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='324.3' cy='409.3' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='271.4' cy='444.6' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='209.0' cy='457.0' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='146.6' cy='444.6' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='93.7' cy='409.3' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='58.4' cy='356.4' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='46.0' cy='294.0' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='58.4' cy='231.6' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='93.7' cy='178.7' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='146.6' cy='143.4' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='209.0' cy='131.0' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='271.4' cy='143.4' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='324.3' cy='178.7' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><circle cx='359.6' cy='231.6' r='4.2' fill='#c9a24b' stroke='#7a5c1e' stroke-width='1'/><text x='209' y='486' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace' font-size='11' fill='#9fd0cc' letter-spacing='2'>PORTHOLE PORTRAIT / ARTIST RENDERING</text><g font-family='monospace' font-size='14' fill='#c9a24b'><text x='406' y='158'>FULL NAME</text><text x='406' y='225'>OCCUPATION</text><text x='406' y='291'>SPECIALTIES</text><text x='406' y='390'>DISTINGUISHING FEATURES</text></g><g font-family='Georgia,serif' fill='#eef6f3'><text x='406' y='186' font-size='23'>Prince Dakkar, called Nemo</text><text x='406' y='252' font-size='23'>Commander of the Nautilus</text><text x='406' y='319' font-size='21'>Engineering · oceanography</text><text x='406' y='346' font-size='21'>Navigation · the pipe organ</text><text x='406' y='420' font-size='20'>Captain's cap · brass helmet</text><text x='406' y='449' font-size='20'>Black flag, golden N</text></g><path d='M407 198H735M407 265H735M407 361H735' stroke='#7a5c1e'/><text x='390' y='520' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='28' font-style='italic' text-anchor='middle' fill='#f3e3b3'>Mobilis in mobili</text><text x='390' y='552' font-family='monospace' font-size='12' letter-spacing='3' text-anchor='middle' fill='#9fd0cc'>ENGINEER · EXPLORER · EXILE</text></svg></div></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>01 · Character Profile</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#10252f'>The Man Without a Name</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Name:</b> Captain Nemo (Latin for &quot;no one&quot;)</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Born:</b> Prince Dakkar, son of a rajah of Bundelkhand, India (revealed in <i>The Mysterious Island</i>)</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Occupation:</b> Engineer, naturalist and commander of the <i>Nautilus</i></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Creator:</b> Jules Verne</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>First appearance:</b> <i>Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Seas</i> (1870)</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Motto:</b> <i>Mobilis in mobili</i>, moving through the moving element</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #c9a24b;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Personality</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Brilliant, solitary, proud and deeply melancholy.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Nemo is a scientist who built a world beneath the waves, and a man who has never forgiven the one he left behind.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>He is courteous to his guests, merciless to his enemies and gentle with the poor and the oppressed.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>02 · Seafaring Abilities</div><div style='width:100%;aspect-ratio:490 / 430;border-radius:1.2cqw;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 .4cqw 1.2cqw rgba(42,33,24,.35)'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 490 430' width='100%' height='100%' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid meet' role='img' aria-label='Captain Nemo seafaring abilities'><rect width='490' height='430' rx='16' fill='#0b2530'/><text x='30' y='47' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='29' font-weight='bold' fill='#f3e3b3'>SEAFARING ABILITIES</text><text x='30' y='72' font-family='monospace' font-size='12' fill='#7fb3ad'>ILLUSTRATIVE RATINGS / 10</text><g font-family='system-ui' font-size='15' fill='#e4f0ee'><text x='30' y='111'>ENGINEERING</text><text x='30' y='151'>OCEANOGRAPHY</text><text x='30' y='191'>NAVIGATION</text><text x='30' y='231'>LEADERSHIP</text><text x='30' y='271'>MUSICIANSHIP</text><text x='30' y='311'>COMBAT</text><text x='30' y='351'>MERCY</text><text x='30' y='391'>DIPLOMACY</text></g><g fill='#1d4452'><rect x='204' y='94' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='134' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='174' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='214' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='254' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='294' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='334' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='374' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/></g><g fill='#2aa6a0'><rect x='204' y='94' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='134' width='226' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='174' width='203' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='214' width='203' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='254' width='181' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='294' width='158' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='334' width='136' height='14' rx='7'/><rect x='204' y='374' width='68' height='14' rx='7'/></g></svg></div></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>03 · The Nautilus and Its Kit</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#10252f'>The Nautilus and Its Kit</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Nautilus</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A cigar-shaped submarine about seventy metres long, built in secret from parts made across the world and driven entirely by electricity.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Ram</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A steel spur on the bow, used to break through ice and to sink warships.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Salon</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A pipe organ, a library of twelve thousand volumes and a museum of treasures from the sea floor.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Diving Suits</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Compressed-air suits with electric lamps, and electric guns for hunting underwater.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Black Flag</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A black flag with a golden N, planted at the South Pole.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #c9a24b;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Field philosophy:</b> Take everything you need from the sea, and owe nothing to the land.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>04 · Strengths and Flaws</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#10252f'>Strengths and Flaws</div><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#0f5560'>Strengths</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Engineering genius:</b> Conceived and built the Nautilus decades ahead of any navy.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Self-sufficiency:</b> Lives entirely on what the ocean gives: food, clothing, even fuel.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Discipline:</b> Commands a silent, loyal crew with calm authority.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Compassion:</b> Saves a pearl diver from a shark and sends gold to rebels fighting for freedom.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Curiosity:</b> Maps the sea floor and studies a world no one else can reach.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #c9a24b;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#0f5560'>Weaknesses</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Vengefulness:</b> A hatred of tyranny that turns into destruction.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Secrecy:</b> Keeps his guests aboard for life so no one can reveal the Nautilus.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Isolation:</b> Has chosen the company of the sea over people.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Grief:</b> The loss of his family never leaves him.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Pride:</b> Believes his own law stands above the world&#39;s.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>05 · Guests, Crew and Castaways</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#10252f'>Guests, Crew and Castaways</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Professor Pierre Aronnax</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Guest and Narrator</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A French marine biologist whose curiosity binds him to Nemo even as he longs to be free.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Conseil</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Guest / Loyal Servant</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Aronnax&#39;s cheerful, orderly companion, who classifies everything he sees.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Ned Land</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Prisoner / Harpooner</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>A Canadian harpooner who wants nothing but escape, and the guest who trusts Nemo least.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Crew</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Silent Loyalists</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Men bound to Nemo and to one another, who speak among themselves in a language Aronnax cannot place.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Cyrus Smith</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Secret Beneficiary</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>The engineer of <i>The Mysterious Island</i>, whose party of castaways Nemo quietly helps.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>06 · Legendary Voyages</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#10252f'>Legendary Voyages</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Ceylon | The Pearl Fisheries</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Objective:</b> Gather pearls and watch the divers at work.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Threat:</b> A shark that attacks a diver, and a fight Nemo and Ned Land win together.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Vigo Bay | The Sunken Treasure</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Objective:</b> Recover gold from sunken Spanish galleons.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Threat:</b> None but time. The gold is meant for those who need it.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>21 March 1868 | The South Pole</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Objective:</b> Reach the Pole beneath the ice and plant the flag.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Threat:</b> An iceberg that seals the Nautilus in, and air running low.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Open Ocean | The Giant Squids</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Objective:</b> Cross the deep and keep to the course.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Threat:</b> A pack of giant squids and the loss of a crewman Nemo mourns.</p><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>Off Norway | The Maelstrom</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Objective:</b> Disappear.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Threat:</b> The whirlpool itself, where the Nautilus is last seen.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #c9a24b;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Recurring theme:</b> The sea offers freedom from the world, but Nemo cannot stop reacting to the world he left.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>07 · Character Psychology</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#10252f'>The Heart of the Character</div><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#0f5560'>What does he want?</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Freedom: to live beyond the reach of any government, and to learn everything the sea can teach.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#0f5560'>What does he need?</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>To forgive, and to rejoin the human world he rejected before his grief costs him everything.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#0f5560'>His central contradiction</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Nemo is a humane man who commits acts of violence, and a champion of the oppressed who holds captives.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>He wants to be no one, yet he cannot stop answering to the world he left.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#0f5560'>His heroic flaw</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>His grief hardened into a creed, and the cause that cost him his family has become a cage.</p><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#0f5560'>His defining quality</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>He is magnificent and unforgivable at once.</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'>Readers admire his genius and fear his certainty, and Verne never lets either feeling win.</p></section><section style='margin-top:3.2cqw;padding-top:2.2cqw;border-top:.2cqw solid #c9a24b'><div style='font:700 1.1cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;margin-bottom:1cqw'>08 · Character Essence</div><div style='font:700 2.9cqw/1.15 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:0 0 1.4cqw;color:#10252f'>CAPTAIN NEMO</div><div style='font:700 1.6cqw/1.25 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.3cqw 0 .4cqw;color:#0f5560;letter-spacing:.02em'>The Exile Who Made the Sea His Country</div><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Archetype:</b> Explorer / Inventor / Tragic Antihero</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Motivation:</b> Freedom, knowledge and a lasting answer to tyranny.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Greatest strength:</b> Visionary engineering backed by iron discipline.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Greatest weakness:</b> Vengeance, secrecy and a grief he will not let go.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Internal conflict:</b> Compassion against the cold justice he has appointed himself to deliver.</p><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><b style='color:#10252f'>Character arc:</b> From vengeful exile to an old man who spends his last strength helping others.</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:.15cqw solid #c9a24b;margin:1.6cqw 0;opacity:.7'><p style='margin:0 0 1.1cqw;font-size:1.5cqw;line-height:1.55'><i>He didn&#39;t conquer the sea. He made it the only place he could be himself.</i></p></section><div style='margin-top:3.6cqw;font:400 1.1cqw/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a5c1e;text-align:center'>9 sections, assembled in reading order</div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail: the whole log as one document. The Method writes it from the section cards, in reading order, so edit those and not this.",
        "link": ""
      }
    },
