      ],
      "style": {
        "background": "#0f2a38",
        "color": "#e4f0ee",
        "borderColor": "#c9a24b",
        "borderWidth": 2,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "altText": "Vintage expedition dossier featuring Indiana Jones's silhouette, fedora and whip, with his name, profession, era, and defining quotation.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Guests, Crew and Castaways\n\n### Professor Pierre Aronnax\n**Guest and Narrator**\n\nA French marine biologist whose curiosity binds him to Nemo even as he longs to be free.\n\n### Conseil\n**Guest / Loyal Servant**\n\nAronnax's cheerful, orderly companion, who classifies everything he sees.\n\n### Ned Land\n**Prisoner / Harpooner**\n\nA Canadian harpooner who wants nothing but escape, and the guest who trusts Nemo least.\n\n### The Crew\n**Silent Loyalists**\n\nMen bound to Nemo and to one another, who speak among themselves in a language Aronnax cannot place.\n\n### Cyrus Smith\n**Secret Beneficiary**\n\nThe engineer of *The Mysterious Island*, whose party of castaways Nemo quietly helps."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "d404e589-fff7-4cad-814a-f96c0e73b3c2"
        },
