        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "altText": "Vintage expedition dossier featuring Indiana Jones's silhouette, fedora and whip, with his name, profession, era, and defining quotation.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Legendary Voyages\n\n### Ceylon | The Pearl Fisheries\n**Objective:** Gather pearls and watch the divers at work.\n\n**Threat:** A shark that attacks a diver, and a fight Nemo and Ned Land win together.\n\n### Vigo Bay | The Sunken Treasure\n**Objective:** Recover gold from sunken Spanish galleons.\n\n**Threat:** None but time. The gold is meant for those who need it.\n\n### 21 March 1868 | The South Pole\n**Objective:** Reach the Pole beneath the ice and plant the flag.\n\n**Threat:** An iceberg that seals the Nautilus in, and air running low.\n\n### The Open Ocean | The Giant Squids\n**Objective:** Cross the deep and keep to the course.\n\n**Threat:** A pack of giant squids and the loss of a crewman Nemo mourns.\n\n### Off Norway | The Maelstrom\n**Objective:** Disappear.\n\n**Threat:** The whirlpool itself, where the Nautilus is last seen.\n\n---\n\n**Recurring theme:** The sea offers freedom from the world, but Nemo cannot stop reacting to the world he left."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "d404e589-fff7-4cad-814a-f96c0e73b3c2"
        },
        "documentOrder": 6
      }
    },
    {
